SUMMARY:RMSD Program: Registration Deadline
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DESCRIPTION:Deadline to register via REDCap for the Research Mentorship and
  Scholarly Development (RMSD) Program\, open to MS1–MS4 students at the 
 Houston and Temple campuses. Program includes three 15-minute self-paced e
 Learning modules\, three 90-minute case-based Microsoft Teams workshops\, 
 near-peer mentorship with RMSD Student Fellows\, and a reflection tool\; c
 ompleting all components earns a SOAR Completion Letter that can be listed
  on a CV/residency application.\nHost: SOAR Office\, Baylor College of Med
 icine\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/even
 t/255.html
URL:https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/event/255.html
CATEGORIES:Deadline
END:VEVENT
